  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Distributed Value near $3.61B (-0.9% 30D) keeps the lane in a holding pattern\u2014liquidity and platform concentration still dominate. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-nominees-johnson-levine-tokenized-stocks?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Trump\u2019s SEC nominee Johnson backs formal rulemaking for tokenized stock trading</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/gta-vi-launch-tokenized-ttwo-trade-triple-nvidia?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GTA VI publisher racks up nearly 3x Nvidia\u2019s tokenized stock volume</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-19-ant-international-protocol-tokenized-assets-443586\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ant International launches protocol for real-time settlement between tokenized deposits and money market funds</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/podcasts-and-videos/podcast/who-decides-which-chains-count-as-public-or-cosmos-zenith-injective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Who Decides Which Chains Count as Public? | Cosmos, Zenith, Injective</a> (The Defiant).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
